flowchart TD
  EVENT[PR / development push / manual trigger] --> CHECKOUT[Checkout and locked dependencies]
  CHECKOUT --> LINT[Ruff, ESLint, actionlint]
  LINT --> UNIT[Backend unit + Vitest 80 percent line gate]
  UNIT --> INT[Backend API, SQLite and Stubber integration]
  INT --> BUILD[Frontend build and QA Docker image builds]
  BUILD --> E2E[Playwright: isolated React and FastAPI with fixture adapter]
  E2E --> SEC[Security tests, scanners and controlled performance]
  SEC --> COV[Backend 80 percent line gate]
  COV --> REPORT[Generate coverage and consolidated reports]
  REPORT --> PASS[Review quality results]
  CHECKOUT -.->|always after job| ART[Upload evidence; no credentials]
  MANUAL[Separate manual delivery workflow] --> ENV[production-review protected environment]
  ENV --> MANIFEST[Commit and SHA256 source manifest]
  MANIFEST --> STOP[No deployment implemented; hosting target unknown]
